MediumModalPopupWindow({page:AH.PrependBasePath(MakeURL('/client/checkemployerdupe.esp',checkemployerdupeargs)),title:'Possible Employer Duplicates'});}}});}
function Cookie(document,name,domain,path){this.$document=document;this.$name=name;this.$expires=new Date(9999,11,31);this.$path=(path)?path:null;this.$domain=(domain)?domain:null;}
Cookie.prototype.store=function(){var cookieval="";for(var prop in this){if(prop.charAt(0)=='$'||typeof this[prop]=='function'){continue;}
if(cookieval!=""){cookieval+='&';}
cookieval+=prop+':'+escape(this[prop]);}
var cookie=this.$name+'='+cookieval;if(this.$expires)cookie+='; expires='+this.$expires.toGMTString();if(this.$path)cookie+='; path='+this.$path;if(this.$domain)cookie+='; domain='+this.$domain;cookie+='; secure';this.$document.cookie=cookie;}
Cookie.prototype.load=function(){var allcookies=this.$document.cookie;if(allcookies=="")return false;var start=allcookies.indexOf(this.$name+'=');if(start==-1)return false;start+=this.$name.length+1;var end=allcookies.indexOf(';',start);if(end==-1){end=allcookies.length;}
var cookieval=allcookies.substring(start,end);var a=cookieval.split('&');for(var i=0;i<a.length;i++){a[i]=a[i].split(':');this[a[i][0]]=unescape(a[i][1]);}
return true;}
function GetCookieValue(name){var allcookies=document.cookie;var matched=allcookies.match(new RegExp('('+name+')=([^;]*)'));return matched&&RegExp.$1?RegExp.$2:'';}
function SetCookieValue(name,arg){var cookie=new Cookie(document,name,'athenahealth.com','/');cookie.load();for(var value in arg){cookie[value]=arg[value];}
cookie.store();}
function CanonicalFrameSize(args){args=args||{};if(!args.PRESERVEWRAPPERSIZE){var wrapperframeset=AH.getElementById('frWrapper');if(args.SHOWRESUMESESSIONFRAME){if(wrapperframeset){wrapperframeset.rows=sprintf("*,0,%s0%s",AH.GlobalElements&&AH.GlobalElements.GlobalNav?'':'0,',AH.GlobalElements&&AH.GlobalElements.Status?'':',0');}
if(keys(AH.GlobalElements).length){AH.Frames.Top.Frame().HideGlobalElements();}
if(top.jQuery){top.jQuery('div.simplemodal-overlay,div.simplemodal-container').hide();}}
else if(AH.GetGlobal('COMMUNICATOROPERATORSIZE')){wrapperframeset.rows="0,0,32,"+AH.GetGlobal('COMMUNICATOROPERATORSIZE')+",*,26";jQuery(AH.Frames.GlobalNav.Document()).scrollTop(0);}
else if(isDefined(AH.GetGlobal('SSIWIZARD'))||args.HIDEALLGLOBALELEMENTS){wrapperframeset.rows=sprintf("0,0,%s*%s",AH.GlobalElements&&AH.GlobalElements.GlobalNav?'':'0,',AH.GlobalElements&&AH.GlobalElements.Status?'':',0');if(keys(AH.GlobalElements).length){AH.Frames.Top.Frame().HideGlobalElements();}}
else{if(wrapperframeset){wrapperframeset.rows=sprintf("0,0,%s*%s",AH.GlobalElements&&AH.GlobalElements.GlobalNav?'':'32,',AH.GlobalElements&&AH.GlobalElements.Status?'':',26');}
if(keys(AH.GlobalElements).length){AH.Frames.Top.Frame().ShowGlobalElements();}
jQuery(AH.Frames.GlobalNav.Document()).scrollTop(0);if(top.jQuery){top.jQuery('div.simplemodal-overlay,div.simplemodal-container').show();}}}
if(!args.PRESERVECONTENTSIZE){var contentwidth;if(AH.getElementById('frameContent')){contentwidth={framesetScheduleNavWrapper:0,frMainWrapper:jQuery(AH.Wrappers.FrameContentWrapper()).width()-jQuery(AH.Separators.ContentSeparator()).width()};}
else{contentwidth={framesetContent:"0,*"};}
AH.SetContentColumns(contentwidth);}}
function InitOrderSelect(){jQuery("[name='sortable']").sortable({revert:true,helper:"clone"});jQuery("ul, li").disableSelection();}
function OrderSelectUpdateSelected(id){id=EscapeJQuerySelector(id);var itemjq=jQuery('#'+id+'_item');var inputjq=itemjq.children('#'+id+'_input');if(event.srcElement.tagName=='INPUT'){if(inputjq.is(':checked')){itemjq.attr('class','ui-state-selected');}
else{itemjq.attr('class','ui-state-default');}}
else{if(inputjq.is(':checked')){inputjq.prop('checked',false);itemjq.attr('class','ui-state-default');}
else{inputjq.prop('checked',true);itemjq.attr('class','ui-state-selected');}}}
function OrderSelectGetSubmit(){jQuery("[name='sortable']").each(function(){var idroot=this.id.replace('_sortable','');var checkeditems=[];jQuery(this).find("input:checked").each(function(){checkeditems.push(this.value);});if(checkeditems.length){document.getElementById(idroot).value=checkeditems.join("\t");}});}
function ToggleDropdown(id){RefreshFacit();AH.SetGlobal('activecomponent',id);var dropdown=_FetchElementByID(id);if(dropdown.style.display!=="block"){ShowDropdown(dropdown);}else{HideDropdown(dropdown);}
return false;}
function BarItemMouseOver(baritem){if(baritem.className=='inactive'||baritem.className==''){baritem.className='active';if(isDefined(AH.GetGlobal('menubaractive'))&&AH.GetGlobal('menubaractive')!==''){var newdropdownid=baritem.id.split('_')[0]+'_'+baritem.id.split('_')[1];if(AH.GetGlobal('menubaractive')==newdropdownid){return;}
var olddropdown=document.getElementById(AH.GetGlobal('menubaractive'));HideDropdown(olddropdown);var newdropdown=_FetchElementByID(newdropdownid);ShowDropdown(newdropdown);}}}
function BarItemMouseOut(baritem){if(baritem.className=='active'){baritem.className='inactive';}}
function ShowDropdown(dropdown){var sourceelement=_FetchJqueryElementByID(dropdown.id+'_span');var offset=sourceelement.offset();var dropdownoffset={top:offset.top+sourceelement.outerHeight(),left:offset.left};if(dropdownoffset.left+jQuery(dropdown).outerWidth()>AH.Frames.Main.Document().body.clientWidth){dropdownoffset.left=AH.Frames.Main.Document().body.clientWidth-jQuery(dropdown).outerWidth();}
jQuery(dropdown).show().offset(dropdownoffset).offset(dropdownoffset);dropdown.focus();var baritem=_FetchElementByID(dropdown.id+'_span');baritem.className='fixedactive';AH.SetGlobal('menubaractive',dropdown.id);}
function HideDropdown(dropdown){if(dropdown.style.display=="none"){return;}
dropdown.style.display="none";var baritem=_FetchElementByID(dropdown.id+'_span');baritem.className='inactive';AH.SetGlobal('menubaractive','');}
function _FetchElementByID(id){var element=AH.Frames.Main.getElementById(id);if(!element){element=document.getElementById(id);}
return element;}
function _FetchJqueryElementByID(id){var sourceelement=jQuery('#'+id,AH.Frames.Main.Document());if(sourceelement.length==0){sourceelement=jQuery('#'+id,document);}
return sourceelement;}
function GoPatient(url,patientid,chartid,title,id,departmentid,providergroupid,claimid){var chartidstring=isDefined(chartid)&&!isNull(chartid)?'&CHARTID='+chartid:'';var departmentidstring=isDefined(departmentid)&&!isNull(departmentid)?'&DEPARTMENTID='+departmentid:'&DEPARTMENTID='+AH.GetGlobal('DEPARTMENTID');var providergroupidstring=isDefined(providergroupid)&&!isNull(providergroupid)?'&PROVIDERGROUPID='+providergroupid:'';var claimidstring=isDefined(claimid)&&!isNull(claimid)?'&CLAIMID='+claimid:'';if(title){var idvalue=id||title;var newurl=escape(url+'PATIENTID='+patientid+chartidstring);AH.Frames.Main.SetLocation(AH.PrependBasePath('/clinicals/charttabs.esp?PATIENTID='+patientid+chartidstring+'&ID='+idvalue+'&TITLE='+title+'&URL='+newurl));}
else{document.location.href=AH.PrependBasePath(url+'PATIENTID='+patientid+chartidstring+departmentidstring+providergroupidstring+claimidstring);}}
function AutoScroll(forcescroll,object){if(AH.UserPreferences){var autoscroll=AH.GetUserPreference('ENABLEENCOUNTERAUTOSCROLL');if(!autoscroll||autoscroll==0){return;}}
var ycoordinate;if(event.srcElement.type=='text'){ycoordinate=parseInt(event.clientY-event.offsetY);}else{ycoordinate=parseInt(event.clientY);}
var bodyheight=document.body.clientHeight;if(ycoordinate&&bodyheight){var edgeheight=parseInt(bodyheight/5);var topthird=parseInt(bodyheight/3);var diffvalue;var temp=object;var top=object.offsetHeight;var scrollobj;while(temp){if(temp.tagName=='DIV'&&temp.currentStyle!=null&&(temp.currentStyle.overflow=='auto'||temp.currentStyle.overflow=='scroll')){scrollobj=temp;break;}
temp=temp.parentNode;}
if(typeof scrollobj!='undefined'){var tempobject=object;var top=tempobject.offsetHeight;while(tempobject){if(tempobject==scrollobj){break;}
top+=tempobject.offsetTop;tempobject=tempobject.offsetParent;}
ycoordinate=eval(top-scrollobj.scrollTop);bodyheight=scrollobj.offsetHeight;edgeheight=parseInt(bodyheight/3);topthird=parseInt(bodyheight/3);}
if(forcescroll||(ycoordinate>bodyheight-edgeheight)||(ycoordinate<edgeheight)){var scrolldistance=ycoordinate-topthird;if(typeof scrollobj!='undefined'){if(scrolldistance<0&&scrollobj.scrollTop==0){return false;}
setTimeout(function(){ScrollTo(scrolldistance,scrollobj);},2);}
else{setTimeout(function(){Scroll(scrolldistance);},2);}}}
return 0;}
function ScrollTo(scrolldistance,scrollobj){jQuery(scrollobj).animate({scrollTop:(scrolldistance>0?"+=":"-=")+Math.abs(scrolldistance)});}
var scrolltimeout=null;function Scroll(scrolldistance){jQuery('html > body').animate({scrollTop:(scrolldistance>0?"+=":"-=")+Math.abs(scrolldistance)});}
function UpdateTaskbarForAppointment(apptdate,apptid,deptid){if(!isDefined(apptdate)||!isDefined(apptid)||!isDefined(deptid)||!AH.IsMain||!AH.Frames.ScheduleNav||!AH.Frames.ScheduleNav.IsVisible()){return false;}
var schedulenavlocation=AH.Frames.ScheduleNav.GetLocation().toString();if(schedulenavlocation.match(/schedulenavbilling.esp/)){AH.Frames.ScheduleNav.Reload();return;}
if(schedulenavlocation.match(/schedulenav.esp/)||schedulenavlocation.match(/moveapptnav.esp/)){require(['shared:/scripts/athena/utils/cross_frame_events'],function(CrossFrameEventsUtils){var args={SOURCE:'UpdateTaskbarForAppointment',FUNCTIONARGS:{APPOINTMENTDATE:apptdate,ANCHORNAME:apptid,DEPARTMENTID:parseInt(deptid),LOADTYPE:'MANUALREFRESH'}};CrossFrameEventsUtils.trigger('reload-schedulenav-HTML',args);});}}
function UpdateTaskbarDepartment(deptid){if(!AH.Frames.ScheduleNav.Frame()){return;}
if(!AH.Frames.ScheduleNav.GetLocation().toString().match(/schedulenav.esp/)){return false;}
if(AH.Frames.ScheduleNav.IsVisible()){AH.Frames.ScheduleNav.SetLocation(AH.PrependBasePath("/schedule/schedulenav.esp?DEPARTMENTID="+deptid));}}
function CodeCheck(cptarray,icdarray,servicedate,departmentid,icdversion,claimeditflag){var getStringParameters={DEPARTMENTID:departmentid,SERVICEDATE:servicedate,CPTCODE:[],MODIFIER:[],ICDCODE:[],ICDPOINTER:[],ICDVERSION:icdversion,CLAIMEDITFLAG:claimeditflag,MEDICAREPART:[]};if(icdarray.length==0){alert("At least one "+icdversion+" code must be specified");return false;}
var uniqueicd={};var icdmap=[];for(var i=0;i<icdarray.length;i++){var icdmapindex=i;if(uniqueicd[icdarray[i]]!=undefined){icdmap[i+1]=uniqueicd[icdarray[i]];}
else{getStringParameters['ICDCODE'].push(icdarray[i]);icdmap[i+1]=i+1;uniqueicd[icdarray[i]]=i+1;}}
for(var i=0;i<cptarray.length;i++){var modifiers=cptarray[i]['CPT'].split(',');var procedurecode=modifiers.splice(0,1);getStringParameters['CPTCODE'].push(procedurecode);getStringParameters['MODIFIER'].push(jQuery.grep(modifiers,function(item,index){return/.{1,2}/.test(item);}).join(','));var icdpointers=cptarray[i]['ICD'].split(',');for(var icd=0;icd<icdpointers.length;icd++){icdpointers[icd]=icdmap[icdpointers[icd]];}
icdpointers=UniqueElements(icdpointers);getStringParameters['ICDPOINTER'].push(icdpointers.join(','));getStringParameters['MEDICAREPART'].push(cptarray[i]['MEDICAREPART']);}
var win=ModelessLookup(MakeURL(AH.PrependBasePath('/partners/codecorrect/detail/codecheckcms1500.esp'),getStringParameters),'athenaCodesource powered by nThrive',1000,700,0,'cccodecheck',{status:1});win.focus();}
function formatICD9(code){var lengthbeforedot;if(code.match(/^e/i)){lengthbeforedot=4;}
else{lengthbeforedot=3;}
if(code.length>=lengthbeforedot+1){code=code.substring(0,lengthbeforedot)+'.'+code.substring(lengthbeforedot,code.length);}
return code;}
function UniqueElements(array){var elementHash=new Object();var uniquearray=new Array();for(var i=0;i<array.length;i++){elementHash[array[i]]=1;}
for(var i in elementHash){uniquearray.push(i);}
return uniquearray;}
function Check(fieldname,flag){try{var checkobj=document.getElementById(fieldname);if(checkobj&&checkobj.type=="checkbox"&&checkobj.disabled==false){checkobj.checked=flag;}}
catch(e){}
return true;}
function ToggleCheckboxes(matchregex,checkedvalue){for(var i=0;i<event.srcElement.form.elements.length;i++){var e=document.zform.elements[i];if(e.type=="checkbox"&&e.name.match(matchregex)){e.checked=checkedvalue;}}}
var ProcessFlexibleDates=function(inputname,inputmaskname,inputobj,suppressalert,showfulldate){preventformsubmission=0;inputobj.value=TrimWhitespace(inputobj.value.toString());var container=GetSectionContainerIfPossible(inputobj);if(!container){container=document;}
var jqcontainer=jQuery(container);var escapedinputmaskname=EscapeJQuerySelector(inputmaskname);var escapedinputname=EscapeJQuerySelector(inputname);var hiddendatemaskinput=jqcontainer.find('#'+escapedinputmaskname+",[name='"+escapedinputmaskname+"']").get(0);var hiddendateinput=jqcontainer.find('input#'+escapedinputname+",input[name='"+escapedinputname+"']").filter(':hidden').get(0);var regexp;var inputvalue=inputobj.value.toString();var arr;if(!inputvalue){hiddendatemaskinput.value='';hiddendateinput.value='';if(suppressalert&&inputobj.className=='InvalidInput'){if(inputobj.oldclass){inputobj.className=inputobj.oldclass;}
else{inputobj.className=' ';}}
return false;}
if(arr=inputvalue.match(/^(\d{4})$/)){inputobj.value='01/01/'+inputobj.value;if(SetDate(-120,inputobj,suppressalert)){hiddendatemaskinput.value='YYYY';hiddendateinput.value=inputobj.value;}
if(!showfulldate){inputobj.value=arr[1];}}
else if(arr=inputvalue.match(/^(\d{1,2})\/(\d{2}|\d{4})$/)){inputobj.value=arr[1]+'/01/'+arr[2];if(SetDate(-120,inputobj,suppressalert)){hiddendatemaskinput.value='MM/YYYY';hiddendateinput.value=inputobj.value;var outputpattern=inputobj.value.match(/^(\d{2})\/(\d{2})\/(\d{4})$/);if(outputpattern!=null&&!showfulldate){inputobj.value=outputpattern[1]+"/"+outputpattern[3];}}
else if(!showfulldate){inputobj.value=arr[1]+"/"+arr[2];}}
else if((arr=inputvalue.match(/^(\d{1,2})\/(\d{1,2})\/(\d{2}|\d{4})$/))||(arr=inputvalue.match(/t[+-]?\d*/i))){if(SetDate(-120,inputobj,suppressalert)){hiddendatemaskinput.value='MM/DD/YYYY';hiddendateinput.value=inputobj.value;}
else if(suppressalert){inputobj.oldclass=inputobj.className;inputobj.className='InvalidInput';return false;}}
else if(arr=inputvalue.match(/^(\d{2})(\d{2})(\d{4})$/)){inputobj.value=arr[1]+'/'+arr[2]+'/'+arr[3];if(SetDate(-120,inputobj,suppressalert)){hiddendatemaskinput.value='MM/DD/YYYY';hiddendateinput.value=inputobj.value;}
else if(suppressalert){inputobj.oldclass=inputobj.className;inputobj.className='InvalidInput';return false;}}
else if(arr=inputvalue.match(/^(\d{4})\-(\d{2})\-(\d{2})$/)){hiddendateinput.value=arr[2]+'/'+arr[3]+'/'+arr[1];}
else if(inputobj.value!=''){if(!suppressalert){if(!(inputobj.getAttribute('validationpending')=='1')){alert('Valid Date formats are : YYYY or MM/YYYY or MM/DD/YYYY');}
preventformsubmission=1;inputobj.setAttribute('validationpending',1);setTimeout(function(){inputobj.focus();inputobj.setAttribute('validationpending',0);},100);}
else{inputobj.oldclass=inputobj.className;inputobj.className='InvalidInput';}
return false;}
if(inputobj.className=='InvalidInput'){if(inputobj.oldclass){inputobj.className=inputobj.oldclass;}
else{inputobj.className=' ';}}}
function GreatestCommonDivisor(a,b){return b==0?a:GreatestCommonDivisor(b,a%b);}
function GetShowTime(time){var hr=Math.floor(time/3600)%24;var ampm=hr<12?'AM':'PM';hr=hr%12;if(hr==0)hr=12;var min=Math.floor((time%3600)/60);if(hr<10)hr="0"+hr;if(min<10)min="0"+min;return hr+':'+min+' '+ampm;}
function DeleteNode(obj){obj.parentNode.removeChild(obj);}
function CancelBubble(event){var locale=event;if(!locale){locale=window.event;}
if(typeof locale.stopPropagation!="undefined"){locale.stopPropagation();}
else{locale.cancelBubble=true;}}
function CallAsEvent(element,eventname){var event;if(isFunction(element[eventname])){event=element[eventname];}
else if(isFunction(element.getAttribute(eventname))){event=element.getAttribute(eventname);}
else{var text=element[eventname]||element.getAttribute(eventname);var functiontext="event = function(){\n"+text+"}\n";eval(functiontext);}
event.apply(element);}
function ValidatedSwapBetweenSelects(fromobject,toobject){if(fromobject.name=='REQUIREDFIELDS'){for(i=0;i<fromobject.length;i++){if(fromobject[i].selected==true&&(fromobject[i].text.indexOf("*")>0)){alert('Removal of required field from the list is not allowed.');return false;}}}
SwapBetweenSelects(fromobject,toobject);}
function MoveUp(selectbox){with(selectbox){for(i=1;i<length;i++){if(i>0&&options[i].selected&&!options[i-1].selected){MoveWithinSelect(selectbox,i,i-1);options[i-1].selected=true;options[i].selected=false;}}}}
function MoveDown(selectbox){with(selectbox){for(i=length-2;i>=0;i--){if(i<(length-1)&&options[i].selected&&!options[i+1].selected){MoveWithinSelect(selectbox,i,i+1);options[i+1].selected=true;options[i].selected=false;}}}}
function MoveWithinSelect(object,fromindex,toindex){with(object){otext=options[fromindex].text;ovalue=options[fromindex].value;options[fromindex].text=options[toindex].text;options[fromindex].value=options[toindex].value;options[toindex].text=otext;options[toindex].value=ovalue;}}
function MakeGetString(query){if(query){var pairs=[];for(var key in query){if(isFunction(query[key])){continue;}
else if(isArray(query[key])){for(var i=0;i<query[key].length;i++){pairs.push(encodeURIComponent(key)+'='+encodeURIComponent(query[key][i]));}}
else{var value=query[key]?encodeURIComponent(query[key]):'';pairs.push(encodeURIComponent(key)+'='+value);}}
return pairs.join('&');}
return'';}
function MakeURL(url,query){var getstring='';if(query){getstring=MakeGetString(query);}
return url+'?'+getstring;}
