function ToggleNonBillableProviders(nonbillableproviders){var checkbox=GetChild(document,'name','SHOWNONBILLABLEPROVIDERSCHECKBOX');var providermulticheck=GetChild(document,'name','PROVIDERMULTICHECK');if(!providermulticheck){providermulticheck=GetChild(document,'name','PROVIDERSPECIALTYMULTICHECK');if(!providermulticheck){return;}}
else{var clearall=GetChild(document,'id',providermulticheck.name+'clearall');clearall.click();}
var multicheckwrapper=GetChild(document,'id',providermulticheck.name+'_wrapper');var options=GetChildren(multicheckwrapper,'tagName','LI');for(var i=0;i<options.length;i++){var option=jQuery(options[i]);if(!option.attr('name')||!option.attr('name').match(/PROVIDER\{(\d+)\}/)){continue;}
var providerid=RegExp.$1;if(!InList(providerid,nonbillableproviders)){continue;}
if(checkbox.checked){option.removeAttr('notsearchable');option.show();}
else{option.attr('notsearchable');option.hide();}}}
function StripeTable(table,rowclassA,rowclassB,excludedclasses){var alternaterow=false;for(var i=1;i<table.rows.length;i++){var currentrow=table.rows[i];if(currentrow.style.display=='none'){continue;}
if(InList(currentrow.className,excludedclasses)){continue;}
currentrow.className=alternaterow?rowclassB:rowclassA;alternaterow=!alternaterow;}}
function StripeP4PTable(measuretable){StripeTable(measuretable,'','AlternateRow',[]);}
function HideAllDrillDownRows(){if(!isDefined(P4PData.sectioncontainer)){return;}
var drilldownrows=GetChildren(P4PData.sectioncontainer,'tagName','tr','id',new RegExp('DRILLDOWN'));for(var i=0;i<drilldownrows.length;i++){if(drilldownrows[i].style.display=='none'){continue;}
var typeitemid=drilldownrows[i].id.match(/(.*)\{(.*)\}DRILLDOWN/);jqdrilldownrow=jQuery(drilldownrows[i]);if(jqdrilldownrow.attr('qm')==1){ToggleQMDrillDown(P4PData.sectioncontainer,typeitemid[2],typeitemid[1]);}}}
function ToggleQMDrillDown(obj,itemid,type){var sectioncontainer=GetSectionContainer(obj);var rowid='#'+EscapeJQuerySelector(type+'{'+itemid+'}');var measurerow=jQuery(rowid,sectioncontainer);var drilldownrow=jQuery(rowid+'DRILLDOWN',sectioncontainer);var expandcollapsespan=jQuery("[name='expandcollapseimg{"+type+"}{"+itemid+"}']",sectioncontainer);if(!measurerow.length||!drilldownrow.length){return;}
var show=drilldownrow.css('display')==='none';measurerow.toggleClass('qm_expandeditem',show);if(show){drilldownrow
.detach()
.insertAfter(measurerow)
.addClass(measurerow.attr('class'));}
drilldownrow.toggle(show);expandcollapsespan
.toggleClass('sprite-arrow-collapse',show)
.toggleClass('sprite-arrow-expand',!show);}
function ShowP4PMeasures(checklist,qualitymanagementtab,clinicalencounterid){var providerid=document.getElementById('P4PPROVIDERDROPDOWN').value;var allproviderids=jQuery('#P4PPROVIDERDROPDOWN').children().map(function(){return this.value;}).get();if(AH.GetGlobal('PATIENTID')){HideAllP4PMeasures();CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::Patient::P4PMeasureList::GenerateMeasureTable',ARGS:{PATIENTID:AH.GetGlobal('PATIENTID'),CHARTID:GetChartID(),PROVIDERID:providerid,QUALITYMANAGEMENTTAB:qualitymanagementtab,CLINICALENCOUNTERID:clinicalencounterid,P4PPROVIDERIDS:allproviderids},ONFINISH:function(measuretable){jQuery('#P4PPROGRAMLIST').html(measuretable.P4PPROGRAMLIST);UpdateP4PStatusFilterCounts('',measuretable.ALLCOUNT,measuretable.NEEDSATTENTIONCOUNT,measuretable.P4PALLCOUNT,measuretable.P4PNEEDSATTENTIONCOUNT);var tablecontainer=GetImmediateChild({CONTEXT:P4PData.sectioncontainer,FILTER:[{ATTRIBUTEKEY:'id',ATTRIBUTEVALUE:'P4PContainer'},{ATTRIBUTEKEY:'tagName',ATTRIBUTEVALUE:'span'}]});SetInnerHTML(tablecontainer,measuretable.HTML);var measurestable=tablecontainer.children[0].children['P4PMeasures'];if(measurestable){MakeSortable(measurestable);}
FilterMeasures();},LOADINGINDICATORFLAG:true});}}
function ToggleQMAddMeasure(){var addmeasure=jQuery("#qmaddmeasure").get(0);if(!isDefined(addmeasure)){return;}
var providerid=document.getElementById('P4PPROVIDERDROPDOWN').value;if(isDefined(P4PData.guidelinesproviders)&&P4PData.guidelinesproviders[providerid]){jQuery(addmeasure).show();}
else{jQuery(addmeasure).hide();}}
function UpdateP4PStatusFilterCounts(checklist,allcount,needsattentioncount,p4pallcount,p4pneedsattentioncount){jQuery("#allcount",P4PData.sectioncontainer).html(allcount);jQuery("#needsattentioncount",P4PData.sectioncontainer).html(needsattentioncount);}
function IncrementQMNeedsAttentionCounts(checklist,needsattention,p4p,decrement){var addend=isDefined(decrement)&&decrement?-1:1;var allspan=jQuery("#allcount",P4PData.sectioncontainer);var sum=parseInt(allspan.html())+addend;allspan.html(sum);if(needsattention==1){var needsattentionspan=jQuery("#needsattentioncount",P4PData.sectioncontainer);var sum=parseInt(needsattentionspan.html())+addend;needsattentionspan.html(sum);}}
function ToggleFilters(){var allfilter=GetChild(document,'name','P4PSTATUSFILTER_ALL');var notsatisfiedfilter=GetChild(document,'name','P4PSTATUSFILTER_NOTSATISFIED');var allfilterspan=document.getElementById('allfilter');var notsatisfiedfilterspan=document.getElementById('notsatisfiedfilter');if(allfilter.value==1){allfilter.value=0;notsatisfiedfilter.value=1;allfilterspan.innerHTML="<a style='cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline' onclick='ToggleFilters()'>All</a>";notsatisfiedfilterspan.innerHTML='Needs Attention';}
else{allfilter.value=1;notsatisfiedfilter.value=0;allfilterspan.innerHTML='All';notsatisfiedfilterspan.innerHTML="<a style='cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline' onclick='ToggleFilters()'>Needs Attention</a>";}
FilterMeasures();}
function ToggleQMRGroupBy(groupby){Assert(!groupby||groupby=='PROVIDER'||groupby=='PROGRAM',"groupby must be either PROVIDER or PROGRAM");var $groupbyprovider=jQuery('#GROUPBYPROVIDER');if(($groupbyprovider.val()==1&&!groupby)||groupby=='PROGRAM'){$groupbyprovider.val('0');groupby='PROGRAM';}
else{$groupbyprovider.val('1');groupby='PROVIDER';}
if(CheckForm('run')){P4P.Report.DisableReportButtons();P4P.Report.SaveReportParameters({REPORTNAME:'Last Report Run',GROUPBY:groupby,RUNREPORT:true});}}
function ToggleDrillDownView(obj,itemid){var clickedspan=GetParent(obj,'tagName','SPAN');var clickedlink=GetChild(clickedspan,'tagName','A');var rowobj=GetParent(clickedspan,'tagName','TD');var drilldowntable=GetParent(obj,'tagName','TABLE','className','p4pdrilldown');var keepclass;var menuitems=new Array('program','exclusion','historical','snooze','edit','notes');for(var i=0;i<menuitems.length;i++){if(clickedspan.id==menuitems[i]+'span{'+itemid+'}'){jQuery(clickedspan).html(clickedlink.innerText);keepclass=menuitems[i];}
else{var otherspan=GetChild(rowobj,'id',menuitems[i]+'span{'+itemid+'}');if(otherspan){jQuery(otherspan).html("<a style='cursor: pointer; text-decoration:underline' onclick='ToggleDrillDownView(this, "+itemid+")'>"+otherspan.innerText+"</a>");}}}
for(var i=0;i<drilldowntable.rows.length;i++){if(drilldowntable.rows[i].className.match(new RegExp(keepclass))||drilldowntable.rows[i].className.match(/_menu/)){drilldowntable.rows[i].style.display='';}
else{drilldowntable.rows[i].style.display='none';}}}
function SetFilter(filterobj,providerids){filterobj.value=providerids;FilterProviders();}
function FilterProviders(){var specialtyfilterobj=GetChild(document,'name','SPECIALTYHIDDEN');var federalidnumberfilterobj=GetChild(document,'name','FEDERALIDNUMBERHIDDEN');var departmentfilterobj=GetChild(document,'name','DEPARTMENTHIDDEN');var applicablefilters=new Array();if(specialtyfilterobj.value&&(specialtyfilterobj.value!='')&&(specialtyfilterobj.value!='undefined')){applicablefilters.push(specialtyfilterobj.value);}
if(federalidnumberfilterobj.value&&(federalidnumberfilterobj.value!='')&&(federalidnumberfilterobj.value!='undefined')){applicablefilters.push(federalidnumberfilterobj.value);}
if(departmentfilterobj.value&&(departmentfilterobj.value!='')&&(departmentfilterobj.value!='undefined')){applicablefilters.push(departmentfilterobj.value);}
var providercount=new Array();var uniqueproviders=new Array();for(var i=0;i<applicablefilters.length;i++){var providers=applicablefilters[i].split(',');uniqueproviders=UniqueElements(providers,uniqueproviders);for(var j=0;j<providers.length;j++){if(!providercount[providers[j]]){providercount[providers[j]]=1;}
else{providercount[providers[j]]++;}}}
var providerstodisplay=new Array();for(var i=0;i<uniqueproviders.length;i++){if(providercount[uniqueproviders[i]]==applicablefilters.length){providerstodisplay.push(uniqueproviders[i]);}}
UpdateProviderMulticheck(providerstodisplay,applicablefilters);}
function UpdateProviderMulticheck(providerids,applicablefilters){var providermulticheck=GetChild(document,'name','PROVIDERMULTICHECK');var clearall=GetChild(document,'id',providermulticheck.name+'clearall');jQuery(clearall).click();var selectedproviderhash={};for(var i=0;i<providerids.length;i++){selectedproviderhash[providerids[i]]=1;}
var multicheckwrapper=GetChild(document,'id',providermulticheck.name+'_wrapper');var options=GetChildren(multicheckwrapper,'tagName','LI','className','ms-available-li-parent');for(var i=0;i<options.length;i++){var option=jQuery(options[i]);option.attr('name').match(/PROVIDER\{(\d+)\}/);var providerid=RegExp.$1;if((providerids.length&&!selectedproviderhash[providerid])||(!providerids.length&&applicablefilters.length)){option.attr('notsearchable');option.hide();}
else{option.removeAttr('notsearchable');option.show();if(applicablefilters.length){option.click();}}}}
function DeleteReport(reportid,reportname){var reportrow=jQuery("tr[id='savedreport{"+reportid+"}']");var savedreportkey=reportname.toUpperCase().replace(/\'/,'\\\'')
delete P4PData.savedreports[savedreportkey];var savedselections=jQuery('#savedselections').get(0);var busy=new BusyIndicator();busy.Start(savedselections,{size:12,ticks:8,tickradius:6,tickwidth:3});CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Report::DeleteReportParameters',ARGS:{REPORTID:reportid},ONFINISH:function(){busy.Stop(savedselections);reportrow.remove();}});}
function FilterMeasures(){HideAllDrillDownRows();var providerid=document.getElementById('P4PPROVIDERDROPDOWN').value;var filtervalue;var allfiltervalue=GetChild(document,'name','P4PSTATUSFILTER_ALL').value;filtervalue=allfiltervalue==1?'ALL':'NEEDSATTENTION';var providermeasures=new Array();jqp4pdatasectioncontainer=jQuery(P4PData.sectioncontainer);if(P4PData&&P4PData.providermeasures){for(var i in P4PData.providermeasures[providerid]){for(var j=0;j<P4PData.providermeasures[providerid][i].length;j++){var p4pmeasuresubscriptionid=P4PData.providermeasures[providerid][i][j];providermeasures.push(p4pmeasuresubscriptionid);var jqmeasurerow=jqp4pdatasectioncontainer.find(EscapeJQuerySelector("tr[id='P4PMEASURESUBSCRIPTION{"+p4pmeasuresubscriptionid+"}']"));if(jqmeasurerow.length){var statuskey=jqmeasurerow.find("span[name='P4PSTATUS']").attr('value');ApplyStatusFilter(jqmeasurerow.get(0),statuskey,filtervalue);}}}}
if(P4PData&&P4PData.dedupemapping){for(var canonicalid in P4PData.dedupemapping){for(var i=0;i<providermeasures.length;i++){if(InList(providermeasures[i],P4PData.dedupemapping[canonicalid])){var jqcanonicalrow=jqp4pdatasectioncontainer.find(EscapeJQuerySelector("tr[id='CANONICAL{"+canonicalid+"}']"));if(jqcanonicalrow.length){var statuskey=jqcanonicalrow.find("span[name=P4PSTATUS]").attr('value');ApplyStatusFilter(jqcanonicalrow.get(0),statuskey,filtervalue);}}}}}
var measuretable=P4PData.sectioncontainer.children['P4PContainer'].children[0].children['P4PMeasures'];if(measuretable){StripeP4PTable(measuretable);}}
function ApplyStatusFilter(measurerow,statuskey,filtervalue){var jqmeasurerow=jQuery(measurerow);if(statuskey=='HIDDEN'||(filtervalue=='NEEDSATTENTION'&&InList(statuskey,['EXCLUDED','SATISFIED','MIXED','SNOOZED']))||(filtervalue=='P4PNEEDSATTENTION'&&(measurerow.getAttribute('p4p')==0||InList(statuskey,['EXCLUDED','SATISFIED','MIXED','SNOOZED'])))||(filtervalue=='P4PALL'&&measurerow.getAttribute('p4p')==0)){jqmeasurerow.hide();}
else{jqmeasurerow.show();if(measurerow.clientHeight===0){jqmeasurerow.hide().show(0);}}}
function HideAllP4PMeasures(){UpdateP4PStatusFilterCounts('',0,0,0,0);var measurerows=GetChildren(P4PData.sectioncontainer,'tagName','tr','id',/P4PMEASURESUBSCRIPTION\{\d+\}/);for(var i=0;i<measurerows.length;i++){measurerows[i].style.display='none';}
var canonicalrows=GetChildren(P4PData.sectioncontainer,'tagName','tr','id',/CANONICAL\{\d+\}/);for(var i=0;i<canonicalrows.length;i++){canonicalrows[i].style.display='none';}}
function PopulateOverrideDate(resultinput,resultinputvalue,dateinputid){if(!resultinput||!resultinput.name||!dateinputid){return;}
var overridedateid=dateinputid;var overridedateinput=document.getElementById(overridedateid);if(!overridedateinput){return;}
if((resultinput.type=='checkbox'&&resultinput.checked)||(resultinput.type!='checkbox'&&resultinput.value)){if(!overridedateinput.value){if(overridedateinput.defaultdate){overridedateinput.value=overridedateinput.defaultdate;}
else{overridedateinput.value='t';}}
overridedateinput.focus();overridedateinput.blur();}
else{overridedateinput.value='';overridedateinput.focus();overridedateinput.blur();}}
function ToggleP4PResultNote(obj,inputname){var notesfield=P4PData.sectioncontainer.all(inputname);if(obj.style.display!='none'){obj.style.display='none';notesfield.style.display='';notesfield.focus();}
else{obj.style.display='';notesfield.style.display='none';}}
function P4PResultNoteOnBlurHandler(obj,linkid,inputname){var notevalue=obj.value;if(!notevalue){var sectioncontainer=GetSectionContainer(obj);ToggleP4PResultNote(sectioncontainer.all(linkid),inputname);}}
function RunP4PCustomReports(p4preportsummary){jQuery('pre.deferredreport',p4preportsummary).each(function(){var placeholderrow=GetParent(this,'tagName','tr','id',/REPORT/);var placeholdercell=placeholderrow.cells[0];var busy=new BusyIndicator();busy.Start(placeholdercell,{size:12,ticks:8,tickradius:6,tickwidth:3});var deferredreport=jQuery(this);CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Report::RunP4PCustomReport',ARGS:{PROGRAMID:deferredreport.attr('programid'),PROVIDERID:deferredreport.attr('providerid'),REPORTFUNCTION:deferredreport.attr('reportfunction'),REPORTCOUNT:deferredreport.attr('reportcount'),GROUPBYPROVIDER:deferredreport.attr('groupbyprovider'),PROVIDERUSERNAME:deferredreport.attr('providerusername'),SUBMISSIONNUMBER:deferredreport.attr('submissionnumber')},ONFINISH:function(rowhtml){busy.Stop(placeholdercell);var swapspan=document.createElement('span');swapspan.style.visibility='hidden';swapspan.innerHTML="<table>"+rowhtml+"</table>";insertAfter(placeholderrow.parentNode,swapspan,placeholderrow);var newrow=GetChild(swapspan,'tagName','tr');newrow.className=placeholderrow.className;newrow.id=placeholderrow.id;placeholderrow.parentNode.replaceChild(newrow,placeholderrow);swapspan.parentNode.removeChild(swapspan);if(!jQuery('#_loading').size()){jQuery('table.deferredreport').each(function(){MakeSortable(this,0,1,1,1);});P4P.Report.EnableReportButtons();}}});});jQuery('table.nondeferredreport').each(function(){MakeSortable(this,0,1,1,1);});}
function DeleteAllDetailedMeasuresAndReports(obj){var p4preportsummary=GetParent(obj,'id','p4preportsummary');var selectedcell=GetChild(p4preportsummary,'className','p4pselectedcell');if(selectedcell){selectedcell.className='p4pnumeralcell';}
var $detailedrows=jQuery('#p4psubreporttable').each(function(index){var parentrow=GetParent(this,'tagName','tr');parentrow.parentNode.removeChild(parentrow);});}
function UpdateTimerElapsed(starttime,objectspan){var elapsed=new Date(new Date()-starttime);var hours=''+elapsed.getUTCHours();var minutes=''+elapsed.getUTCMinutes();var seconds=''+elapsed.getUTCSeconds();var milliseconds=''+elapsed.getUTCMilliseconds();var timestring='';if(hours!=0)timestring+=hours+':';if(minutes!=0){if(minutes.length==1&&hours!=0)minutes='0'+minutes;timestring+=minutes+':';}
if(seconds){if(seconds.length==1)seconds='0'+seconds;timestring+=seconds+'.';}
if(milliseconds){while(milliseconds.length<3)milliseconds='0'+milliseconds;timestring+=milliseconds.small();}
objectspan.html(timestring);}
function GetReportSummaryHTML(){var p4preportsummary=jQuery('#p4preportsummary');p4preportsummary.html('<div style="font-weight: bold;">Please stand by while we run your report.</div><br><b>Elapsed Time: <span id=elapsedtime></span></b><br>');var elapsedtime=jQuery('#elapsedtime');var starttime=new Date();var timerjob=window.setInterval(function(){UpdateTimerElapsed(starttime,elapsedtime)},177);var reportsummaryspan=jQuery('#reportsummaryspan');reportsummaryspan.html('Report Summaries');var url=AH.PrependBasePath('/clinicals/printp4preport.esp?USELASTRUN=1');AthenaPattern_LinkGroup.get_html({FUNCTIONS:[{SUB:'AddLinks',ARGS:[{printlink:{HREF:url,OLDPRINT:sprintf('AH.Frames.Hidden.SetLocation("%s")',url),AUTOGENERATEHEADERSANDFOOTERS:1,TEXT:'Print report summary'}}]}]},function(html){reportsummaryspan.append('<span class="normaltext">'+html+'</span>');});CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Report::GetResultSummaryHTML',ARGS:{USELASTRUN:1,DEFERREPORTS:1},ONFINISH:function(html){window.clearInterval(timerjob);p4preportsummary.html(html);RunP4PCustomReports(p4preportsummary);if(!jQuery('#_loading').size()){P4P.Report.EnableReportButtons();}}});}
function LaunchP4PReportNav(args){AssertFields(args,['REPORTCONFIGURATION','PATIENTID','CHARTID'],[]);var patientid=args.PATIENTID;var chartid=args.CHARTID;var reportconfiguration=args.REPORTCONFIGURATION;var getstring=MakeGetString({PATIENTID:patientid,CHARTID:chartid,REPORTCONFIGURATIONJSON:JSON.stringify(reportconfiguration)});if(!AH.GetGlobal('contextURL')){AH.SetGlobal('contextURL',AH.PrependBasePath('/client/clientsummary.esp?ID='+patientid+'&CHARTID='+chartid));}
AH.Frames.ScheduleNav.SetLocation(AH.PrependBasePath('/clinicals/p4preportnav.esp?'+getstring));}
function ReloadP4PReportNav(args){AssertFields(args,['LINK','PATIENTID','CHARTID','REPORTCONFIGURATION'],['BACKLINK']);var backlink=args.BACKLINK;var chartid=args.CHARTID;var link=args.LINK;var patientid=args.PATIENTID;var reportconfiguration=args.REPORTCONFIGURATION;var reportcontentsdiv=GetParent(link,'id','p4psidebarcontents');var busy=new BusyIndicator();busy.Start(reportcontentsdiv,{size:12,ticks:8,tickradius:6,tickwidth:3});CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Report::GetDetailedResult',ARGS:{REPORTCONFIGURATIONJSON:JSON.stringify(reportconfiguration),CHARTID:chartid,PATIENTID:patientid,BACKLINK:backlink,SIDEBAR:1,RELOAD:1},ONFINISH:function(html){busy.Stop(reportcontentsdiv);SetInnerHTML(reportcontentsdiv,html);}});}
function LaunchP4PCSVWindow(args){var confirmationtypes=args.CONFIRMATIONTYPES;var reportparameters=args.REPORTPARAMETERS;var confirmationmessages={INCLUDESSNAPSHOTS:'Reports exported to CSV will not include patient-level data for archived submission snapshots.'};if(isArray(confirmationtypes)&&confirmationtypes.length>0){var confirmationmessage='Please note the following before proceeding:\n';for(var i=0;i<confirmationtypes.length;i++){confirmationmessage+='\n'
+confirmationmessages[confirmationtypes[i]]
+'\n';}
var confirmation=confirm(confirmationmessage);if(!confirmation){return;}}
var form=jQuery('<form>',{action:AH.PrependBasePath("/clinicals/exportp4preport.esp"),target:"CSV_REPORT",method:'post'});jQuery.each(reportparameters,function(name,value){form.append(jQuery('<input>',{'name':name,'value':value,'type':'hidden'}));});var popup=window.open("","CSV_REPORT");if(!popup){alert("Unable to export report to CSV because your browser is blocking popups. Please enable popups from this site and try again.");return false;}
popup.resizeTo(300,300);form.appendTo("body").submit().remove();}
function ToggleP4PLog(){jQuery('#P4PLOG').toggle('fast').css('overflow','auto');jQuery('#P4PLOGVIEWTYPES').toggle();}
function ToggleP4PLogChildren(togglespan){var parentdiv=GetParent(togglespan,'tagName','div');jQuery(parentdiv).children('div[name="p4plogitem"]').toggle();jQuery(togglespan).children('span[name="p4plogarrow"]').toggleClass('sprite-arrow-expand').toggleClass('sprite-arrow-collapse');}
function ToggleP4PLogViewType(viewtype){jQuery('div[name=p4plogview]').hide();jQuery('#'+viewtype).show();}
function ToggleArchivedPrograms(checkbox){if(checkbox.checked){jQuery('h3[archived=1]').show(0);}
else{jQuery('h3[archived=1]').hide();if(!jQuery('#dashboardprogramaccordion h3.ui-state-active:visible').size()){jQuery('#dashboardprogramaccordion h3:visible:first').click();}}}
function LoadArchivedPrograms(checkbox){if(checkbox.checked){CallRemote({SUB:"Clinical::P4P::Dashboard::GenerateDashboardHTML",ARGS:{FDAT:{},ARCHIVED:1,ONLYACCORDION:1},LOADINGINDICATORFLAG:1,ONFINISH:function(formhtml){jQuery('#accordionhtml').html(formhtml);}});require(['shared:/scripts/athena/utils/cross_frame_events'],function(CrossFrameEventsUtils){CrossFrameEventsUtils.trigger('user-tracking.track-event',{rollout_toggle_key:'AMPLITUDE_ANALYTICS',event_type:'Quality::P4PDashboard::ShowArchived::NA::Click',event_properties:{}});});}
else{CallRemote({SUB:"Clinical::P4P::Dashboard::GenerateDashboardHTML",ARGS:{FDAT:{},ONLYACCORDION:1},LOADINGINDICATORFLAG:1,ONFINISH:function(formhtml){jQuery('#accordionhtml').html(formhtml);}});}}
function StripeEnrollmentTables(){jQuery('table.enrollment').each(function(){StripeTable(this,'AlternateRow','',['enrollmentheader']);});}
function MakeEnrollmentTablesSortable(){jQuery('table.enrollment').each(function(){MakeSortable(this,1,1,1);});}
function ToggleEnrollmentView(obj){var linkspan=GetParent(obj,'tagName','span');var linkid=linkspan.id;var divid=linkid.substring(2);var selectedlabel=divid.replace(/view/,'');var labels=['program','provider','specialty','tin'];for(var i=0;i<labels.length;i++){if(labels[i]===selectedlabel){continue;}
jQuery('#'+labels[i]+'view').hide();jQuery('#by'+labels[i]+'viewlink').show();jQuery('#by'+labels[i]+'viewtext').hide();jQuery('[name=ADD'+labels[i].toUpperCase()+'BUTTON]').hide();}
jQuery('#'+divid).show();jQuery('#'+linkid+'link').hide();jQuery('#'+linkid+'text').show();jQuery('[name=ADD'+selectedlabel.toUpperCase()+'BUTTON]').show();}
function StoreProgramSelection(element){ProgramData.previousSelectedValue=element.value;}
function FilterMeasureMulticheck(element){var measureinput=jQuery('#MEASUREMULTICHECK');var selectordiv=jQuery('#MEASURESELECT');if(measureinput.attr('value')&&ProgramData.previousSelectedValue){var confirmation=confirm("Changing programs will clear all current selections. Are you sure you want to do this?");if(confirmation==false){element.value=ProgramData.previousSelectedValue;return;}
else{GetMultiCheckObj('MEASUREMULTICHECK').ClearAll();selectordiv.html('');}}
else if(measureinput.attr('value')&&nextOperation!='Update'){GetMultiCheckObj('P4PMEASURESUBSCRIPTIONID').ClearAll();}
var program=element.value;if(typeof(program)==='undefined'||program===null||program===''){GetMultiCheckObj('MEASUREMULTICHECK').ClearAll();selectordiv.html('');}
else{CallRemote({SUB:"Clinical::P4P::Enrollment::SpecialtyDefaults::GetMeasureMultiselectHTML",ARGS:{P4PPROGRAMID:program},LOADINGINDICATORFLAG:1,ONFINISH:function(formhtml){selectordiv.html(formhtml);}});}
ProgramData.previousSelectedValue=null;}
function ToggleMeasureSelectionType(type){var measureselectdiv=jQuery('#MEASURESELECTDIV');if(type=='CUSTOM'){measureselectdiv.show();}
else{measureselectdiv.hide();}}
function LoadEnrollmentEdit(view,action,program,provider,specialty,federalidnumber,p4pmeasuresubscriptionid,p4pmeasuregroupid){ClearEnrollmentEdit();CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Enrollment::GetEditHTML',ARGS:{VIEW:view,ACTION:action,PROGRAMID:program,PROVIDERID:provider,SPECIALTYID:specialty,FEDERALIDNUMBER:federalidnumber,P4PMEASURESUBSCRIPTIONID:p4pmeasuresubscriptionid,P4PMEASUREGROUPID:p4pmeasuregroupid},ONFINISH:function(html){jQuery('#editarea').html(html).slideDown('slow');if(jQuery("input[name='MEASURESOURCERADIO']").length!=0){ToggleMeasureSelectionType('SPECIALTYDEFAULTS');}}});}
function ClearEnrollmentEdit(){jQuery('#editarea').slideUp().html('');scroll(0,0);}
function PopulateMeasureSelection(action,view){CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Enrollment::GetMeasureSelect',ARGS:{PROGRAMID:jQuery('input:radio[name=PROGRAMRADIO]:checked').val(),SPECIALTYID:jQuery('input[name*="SPECIALTYHIDDEN"]').val(),PROVIDERID:jQuery('input[name*="PROVIDERHIDDEN"]').val(),ACTION:action,VIEW:view},ONFINISH:function(html){jQuery('#MEASURESELECT').html(html);if(jQuery("input[name='MEASURESOURCERADIO']").length!=0){ToggleMeasureSelectionType('SPECIALTYDEFAULTS');}}});return true;}
function StoreExistingSpecialtySelection(){var previousvalue=jQuery('#SPECIALTYDEFAULTSMULTICHECK').val();if(previousvalue.length!=0){previousvalue=previousvalue.split("\t");var fulllist;for(var i=0;i<previousvalue.length;i++){var msids=previousvalue[i].split(",");if(fulllist){fulllist=fulllist.concat(msids);}
else{fulllist=msids;}}
P4PData.previousSpecialtyDefaultsSelection=fulllist;}
else{P4PData.previousSpecialtyDefaultsSelection=null;}}
function SelectMeasuresForSpecialties(){var value=jQuery('#SPECIALTYDEFAULTSMULTICHECK').val();var fulllist=new Array();if(value.length!=0){var lists=value.split("\t");for(var i=0;i<lists.length;i++){var itemnames=lists[i].split(",");fulllist=fulllist.concat(itemnames);}
for(var i=0;i<fulllist.length;i++){var li=jQuery('li[name="'+fulllist[i]+'"]');if(!li.children('input').prop('checked')){li.click();}}}
if(P4PData&&P4PData.previousSpecialtyDefaultsSelection){for(var i=0;i<P4PData.previousSpecialtyDefaultsSelection.length;i++){var itemname=P4PData.previousSpecialtyDefaultsSelection[i];if(!InList(itemname,fulllist)){var liuncheck=jQuery('li[name="'+itemname+'"]');if(liuncheck.children('input').prop('checked')){liuncheck.click();}}}}}
function ValidateProgramSelection(action,view){var programradio=jQuery('input:radio[name=PROGRAMRADIO]');var stateselection=jQuery('select[name="STATEDROPDOWN"]');var hasprogram=programradio.get(0)&&ReallyVisible(programradio.get(0));var hasstate=stateselection.get(0)&&ReallyVisible(stateselection.get(0));var programid;var state;if(hasprogram){programid=jQuery('input:radio[name=PROGRAMRADIO]:checked').val();}
if(hasstate){state=stateselection.val();}
if(hasprogram&&!programid){alert('Please select a program.');return false;}
else if(hasstate&&state==''){alert('Please select a state.');return false;}
else if(hasprogram&&hasstate){if(qmprogramsubmissiontype[state][programid]!=1){alert('The program and state you selected are not compatible.');return false;}}
else if(view=='TIN'&&action=='ADD'&&!programradio.get(0)){alert('No valid programs.');return false;}
var providerselect=jQuery('#PROVIDERSELECT');if(hasprogram&&providerselect.get(0)){ClearProviderWithEligibility(providerselect);PopulateProviderWithEligibility(action,view);}
if(hasprogram&&jQuery('#MEASURESELECT').get(0)){ClearMeasureSelection();PopulateMeasureSelection(action,view);}
return true;}
function ClearMeasureSelection(){jQuery('#MEASURESELECT').empty();return true;}
function ValidateMeasureSelection(){var measuremulticheck=jQuery('input[name=MEASUREMULTICHECK]');var measuremulticheckwrapper=jQuery('#MEASUREMULTICHECK_wrapper');if(measuremulticheck.get(0)&&ReallyVisible(measuremulticheckwrapper.get(0))&&!jQuery('input[name=MEASUREMULTICHECK]').val()){alert('Please select one or more measures to enroll.');return false;}
return true;}
function ValidateProviderSpecialtySelection(view,p4pprogramid){var programid;if(p4pprogramid!=null){programid=p4pprogramid;}
else{var programradio=jQuery('input:radio[name=PROGRAMRADIO]');var hasprogram=programradio.get(0);if(hasprogram){programid=jQuery('input:radio[name=PROGRAMRADIO]:checked').val();}}
var providerspecialtymulticheck=jQuery('input[name=PROVIDERSPECIALTYMULTICHECK]');var providerspecialtymulticheckwrapper=jQuery('#PROVIDERSPECIALTYMULTICHECK_wrapper');var providermulticheck=jQuery('input[name=PROVIDERMULTICHECK]');var providermulticheckwrapper=jQuery('#PROVIDERMULTICHECK_wrapper');var specialtymulticheck=jQuery('input[name=SPECIALTYMULTICHECK]');var specialtymulticheckwrapper=jQuery('#SPECIALTYMULTICHECK_wrapper');var federalidnumbermulticheck=jQuery('input[name=FEDERALIDNUMBERMULTICHECK]');var federalidnumbermulticheckwrapper=jQuery('#FEDERALIDNUMBERMULTICHECK_wrapper');if(view=='PROGRAM'&&ReallyVisible(providerspecialtymulticheckwrapper.get(0))&&!providerspecialtymulticheck.val()&&!p4pprogramid){alert('Please select one or more providers and/or specialties to enroll.');return false;}
else if(view=='PROVIDER'&&ReallyVisible(providermulticheckwrapper.get(0))&&!providermulticheck.val()){alert('Please select one or more providers to enroll.');return false;}
else if(view=='SPECIALTY'&&ReallyVisible(specialtymulticheckwrapper.get(0))&&!specialtymulticheck.val()){alert('Please select one or more specialties to enroll.');return false;}
else if(view=='TIN'&&ReallyVisible(federalidnumbermulticheckwrapper.get(0))&&!federalidnumbermulticheck.val()){alert('Please select one or more TINs to enroll.');return false;}
if(providerspecialtymulticheck.val()&&providerspecialtymulticheck.val().indexOf("SPECIALTY")>-1&&P4P.Enrollment.DoesProgramAllowSpecialtyEnrollment({'P4PPROGRAMID':programid})==false){alert("Note: You are about to enroll by specialty. Please consult a member of the Clinical Performance team to see if a By Specialty enrollment is appropriate. You should never enroll by Specialty for MU and PQRS.");return false;}
return true;}
function UpdateStateSelection(programradio,state){var stateselection=jQuery('select[name="STATEDROPDOWN"]');var programspecificyn=StateSpecificHash[programradio.value];if(programspecificyn=='Y'){jQuery('#stateselectiontable').show();stateselection.val(state);}
else{jQuery('#stateselectiontable').hide();stateselection.val('');}}
function GoToStep(step,maxsteps,action,view,novalidate){if(!novalidate&&!ValidateRegistrationWizard(action,view)){return;}
if(step>maxsteps&&!ValidateConfiguration()){return;}
jQuery('div[id*="STEP"]').hide();jQuery('span[id*="GUIDE"]').each(function(){if(this.id=='GUIDE{'+step+'}'){this.className='activestep';}
else{this.className='inactivestep';}});if(step>maxsteps){SaveEnrollmentData(action,view);}
else{jQuery('div[id="STEP{'+step+'}"]').show();}
scroll(0,0);return;}
function ValidateConfiguration(){var programid=jQuery('input:radio[name=PROGRAMRADIO]:checked').val();if(!programid){return true;}
var confirmation=1;CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Configuration::GetConfigurationForProgram',ARGS:{P4PPROGRAMID:programid},ASYNC:false,ONFINISH:function(configurations){if(keys(configurations).length>0&&!configurations.SUBSTANDARDCONFIG){var autoapproveproviders=configurations.AUTOAPPROVEPROVIDERS;var badautoapproveprovider=0;for(var providerid in autoapproveproviders){if(!autoapproveproviders[providerid]){badautoapproveprovider=1;}}
var clinicalrequiredfieldproviders=configurations.CLINICALREQUIREDFIELDPROVIDERS;var badclinicalrequiredfieldprovider=0;for(var providerid in clinicalrequiredfieldproviders){if(!clinicalrequiredfieldproviders[providerid]){badclinicalrequiredfieldprovider=1;}}
if(!configurations.DELIVERY||!configurations.DEMOGRAPHICS||!configurations.LETTERSSECTION||!configurations.PORTALACCESS||badautoapproveprovider||badclinicalrequiredfieldprovider){var message='This practice is not optimally configured for this program for the following reasons:\n\n';if(!configurations.DELIVERY){message+='- Missing communicator or Electronic Patient Care Summary Delivery\n';}
if(!configurations.DEMOGRAPHICS){message+='- Missing demographic required fields\n';}
if(!configurations.LETTERSSECTION){message+='- No active appointments configured with letters section\n';}
if(!configurations.PORTALACCESS){message+='- No portal access\n';}
if(badautoapproveprovider){message+='- At least one provider does not have Patient Care Summary set to auto-approve\n';}
if(badclinicalrequiredfieldprovider){message+='- At least one provider does not have Clinicals Required Fields set up correctly\n';}
message+='\nAre you sure you want to continue?';confirmation=confirm(message);}}}});if(!confirmation){return false;}
return true;}
function ValidateRegistrationWizard(action,view){if(action=='ADD'){if(!ValidateMeasureSelection()){return false;}
if(!ValidateProviderSpecialtySelection(view)){return false}}
if(!ValidateProgramSelection(action,view)){return false;}
return true;}
function DeleteEnrollmentData(args){var confirmation=confirm(args["MESSAGE"]);if(!confirmation){return;}
jQuery('span[id*="GUIDE"]').hide();var view=args["VIEW"];delete args["MESSAGE"];delete args["VIEW"];args["ACTION"]="DELETE";var showinactiveprograms=jQuery('[name="SHOWINACTIVEPROGRAMSHIDDEN"]').val();CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Enrollment::SaveEnrollmentData',ARGS:args,ONFINISH:function(html){jQuery('#editarea').html(html).slideDown('slow');var viewarea=jQuery('#viewarea').get(0);var busy=new BusyIndicator();busy.Start(viewarea,{size:12,ticks:8,tickradius:6,tickwidth:3});CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Enrollment::GetViewHTML',ARGS:{SHOWINACTIVEPROGRAMS:showinactiveprograms},ONFINISH:function(html){busy.Stop(viewarea);jQuery('#viewarea').html(html);StripeEnrollmentTables();MakeEnrollmentTablesSortable()
if(view=='PROVIDER'){jQuery('a',jQuery('#byproviderview')).click();}
else if(view=='SPECIALTY'){jQuery('a',jQuery('#byspecialtyview')).click();}
else if(view=='TIN'){jQuery('a',jQuery('#bytinview')).click();}}});}});}
function SaveEnrollmentData(action,view){jQuery('span[id*="GUIDE"]').hide();var programid;jQuery('input:radio[name=PROGRAMRADIO]:checked').each(function(){programid=this.value;});jQuery('input[name*="PROGRAMHIDDEN"]').each(function(){programid=this.value;});var showinactiveprograms=jQuery('[name="SHOWINACTIVEPROGRAMSHIDDEN"]').val();var p4pmeasuresubscriptionids=new Array();var p4pmeasuresubscriptionid;var p4pmeasuregroupids=new Array();var p4pmeasuregroupid;if(jQuery('input[name="MEASUREMULTICHECK"]').val()){var measuremulticheckvalues=jQuery('input[name="MEASUREMULTICHECK"]').val().split('\t');for(var i=0;i<measuremulticheckvalues.length;i++){if(measuremulticheckvalues[i].match(/MEASUREGROUP(\d+)/)){p4pmeasuregroupids.push(RegExp.$1);}
else{p4pmeasuresubscriptionids.push(measuremulticheckvalues[i]);}}}
jQuery('input[name*="MEASUREHIDDEN"]').each(function(){p4pmeasuresubscriptionids.push(this.value);p4pmeasuresubscriptionid=this.value;});jQuery('input[name*="MEASUREGROUPHIDDEN"]').each(function(){p4pmeasuregroupids.push(this.value);p4pmeasuregroupid=this.value;});var usespecialtydefaults;if(jQuery('input[name="MEASURESOURCERADIO"]').attr("checked")){usespecialtydefaults=1;}
if(jQuery('input[name="PROGRAMMEASUREMULTICHECK"]').val()){var multicheckvalues=jQuery('input[name="PROGRAMMEASUREMULTICHECK"]').val().split("\t");for(var i=0;i<multicheckvalues.length;i++){if(multicheckvalues[i].match(/PROGRAM\{(\d+)\}/)){programids.push(RegExp.$1);}
else if(multicheckvalues[i].match(/MEASURE\{(\d+)\}/)){p4pmeasuresubscriptionids.push(RegExp.$1);}}}
var providerids=new Array();if(jQuery('input[name="PROVIDERMULTICHECK"]').val()){providerids=jQuery('input[name="PROVIDERMULTICHECK"]').val().split('\t');}
jQuery('input[name*="PROVIDERHIDDEN"]').each(function(){providerids.push(this.value);});var specialtyids=new Array();if(jQuery('input[name="SPECIALTYMULTICHECK"]').val()){specialtyids=jQuery('input[name="SPECIALTYMULTICHECK"]').val().split('\t');}
jQuery('input[name*="SPECIALTYHIDDEN"]').each(function(){specialtyids.push(this.value);});if(jQuery('input[name="PROVIDERSPECIALTYMULTICHECK"]').val()){var multicheckvalues=jQuery('input[name="PROVIDERSPECIALTYMULTICHECK"]').val().split('\t');for(var i=0;i<multicheckvalues.length;i++){if(multicheckvalues[i].match(/SPECIALTY\{(\d+)\}/)){specialtyids.push(RegExp.$1);}
else if(multicheckvalues[i].match(/PROVIDER\{(\d+)\}/)){providerids.push(RegExp.$1);}}}
var federalidnumbers=new Array();var federalidnumbermulticheck=jQuery('[name=FEDERALIDNUMBERMULTICHECK]');if(federalidnumbermulticheck.val()){federalidnumbers=federalidnumbermulticheck.val().split('\t');}
jQuery('input[name*=TINHIDDEN]').each(function(){federalidnumbers.push(this.value);});var state=jQuery('select[name="STATEDROPDOWN"]').val()||'';CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Enrollment::SaveEnrollmentData',ARGS:{ACTION:action,PROGRAMID:programid,P4PMEASURESUBSCRIPTIONID:p4pmeasuresubscriptionid,P4PMEASURESUBSCRIPTIONIDS:p4pmeasuresubscriptionids,P4PMEASUREGROUPIDS:p4pmeasuregroupids,P4PMEASUREGROUPID:p4pmeasuregroupid,PROVIDERIDS:providerids,SPECIALTYIDS:specialtyids,FEDERALIDNUMBERS:federalidnumbers,STATE:state[0],USESPECIALTYDEFAULTS:usespecialtydefaults},ONFINISH:function(html){jQuery('#editarea').html(html).slideDown('slow');var viewarea=jQuery('#viewarea').get(0);var busy=new BusyIndicator();busy.Start(viewarea,{size:12,ticks:8,tickradius:6,tickwidth:3});CallRemote({SUB:'Clinical::P4P::Enrollment::GetViewHTML',ARGS:{SHOWINACTIVEPROGRAMS:showinactiveprograms},ONFINISH:function(html){busy.Stop(viewarea);jQuery('#viewarea').html(html);StripeEnrollmentTables();MakeEnrollmentTablesSortable()
if(view=='PROVIDER'){jQuery('a',jQuery('#byproviderview')).click();}
else if(view=='SPECIALTY'){jQuery('a',jQuery('#byspecialtyview')).click();}
else if(view=='TIN'){jQuery('a',jQuery('#bytinview')).click();}}});}});}
function EnrollmentToggleAllMeasures(index){var checkbox=jQuery('#MEASUREMULTICHECK_wrapper').find('li[class*="ms-available-li-parent"][index='+index+']').find('input').get(0);var sourceelement=jQuery(event.srcElement);if(sourceelement.attr('name')=='delete'||(event.srcElement!=checkbox&&checkbox.checked)||(event.srcElement==checkbox&&!checkbox.checked)){var confirmation=confirm('This program requires all measures. Clear all measures?');if(confirmation){jQuery('#MEASUREMULTICHECKclearall').click();}
else if(!checkbox.checked){checkbox.checked=true;}
if(event){event.cancelBubble=true;}}
else{var confirmation=confirm('This program requires all measures. Select all measures?');if(confirmation){jQuery('#MEASUREMULTICHECKselectall').click();}
else if(checkbox.checked){checkbox.checked=false;}
if(event){event.cancelBubble=true;}}}
function LogShowActionPanelMetrics(args){var actionPanel=jQuery('#actionpanel,#actionpanelinactive,#nextsteps,#actionsavebuttons,#actiondrugbuttons,#actionordersbuttons,#actionschedulebuttons,#actionchartbuttons');var shouldSample=Math.random()<1/1000;if(actionPanel.is(':visible')&&shouldSample){ClassicMetricsManager.LogMetric('tag',{tag:['show_document_actions',args.DOCUMENTID,args.DOCUMENTCLASS,args.DOCUMENTSUBCLASS].join(' ')});}}
function ToggleActionPanel(){jQuery('#actionpanel,#actionpanelinactive,#nextsteps,#actionsavebuttons,#actiondrugbuttons,#actionordersbuttons,#actionschedulebuttons,#actionchartbuttons').toggle();}
