function UpdateDxMissingICD(needsicdfield){var alldiagnosisorders=jQuery('#ALLDIAGNOSISORDERS');var inicd10=IsICD10(needsicdfield);var dxneedsicd=false;alldiagnosisorders.children('.diagnosisblock').each(function(){var diagnosisordering=this.getAttribute('diagnosisordering');var diagnosiscode=this.getAttribute('diagnosiscode');if(diagnosiscode=='0'){return true;}
if(inicd10){var icd10datamodel=document.getElementsByName("ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{"+diagnosisordering+"}{ICD10DATAMODEL}")[0];var icd10codes=icd10datamodel.value;if(!icd10codes||icd10codes=='-1'){dxneedsicd=true;return false;}}
else{var icd9codeselectortext="[name='ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{"+diagnosisordering+"}{ICD9CODES}']";var icd9codes=jQuery(EscapeJQuerySelector(icd9codeselectortext)).val();var icd9list;var needsicd9=true;if(icd9codes){icd9list=icd9codes.split(/\t/);for(var i=0;i<icd9list.length;i++){if(icd9list[i]!='undefined'){needsicd9=false;}}}
if(needsicd9){dxneedsicd=true;return false;}}});if(dxneedsicd){needsicdfield.val(1);}
else{needsicdfield.val(0);}}
function AllICD9Codes(){var inputs=jQuery('.diagnosisicd9codes');var allcodes={};inputs.each(function(index,element){var codes=element.value.split("\t");for(var i=0;i<codes.length;++i){allcodes[codes[i]]=true;}});return allcodes;}
function MaybeRemoveICD9FromRegistry(code){var registrysection=GetRegistrySection();if(!registrysection){return 0;}
var allicd9codes=AllICD9Codes();if(allicd9codes[code]){return 0;}
var sectionobj=registrysection.prop('sectionobject');return sectionobj.RemoveDiagnosis(code);}
function InitDocumentICD10Picker(donotdefaulticd10){var icd10container=jQuery('#documentdiagnosiscodeicd10view');var snomedcode=jQuery('#DOCUMENTSNOMEDDIAGNOSIS').val();if(!snomedcode){return;}
var icd10field=jQuery('#DOCUMENTDIAGNOSISCODEICD10');var dxorderdata=jQuery.parseJSON(jQuery('#DIAGNOSISORDERDATA').val());var noneselectedtext="No ICD-10 codes have been added to this diagnosis. To add an ICD-10 code, please return to the encounter.";var defaulticd10s='';var defaulticd10texts='';var ordercount=0;if(dxorderdata&&dxorderdata[snomedcode]){ordercount=dxorderdata[snomedcode].ORDERCOUNT;var icd10codes=[];var icd10texts=[];if(ordercount>0){var icdcodes=dxorderdata[snomedcode].ICDCODES;if(icdcodes.length&&icdcodes[0].ICDCODEALLID!=-1){for(var i=0;i<icdcodes.length;i++){if(icdcodes[i].CODESET==='ICD10'){icd10codes.push(icdcodes[i].ICDCODEALLID);icd10texts.push(icdcodes[i].DESCRIPTION);}}}
else{icd10texts.push(noneselectedtext);}}
defaulticd10s=icd10codes.join("\t");defaulticd10texts=icd10texts.join("; ");}
var selectedicd10id=icd10field.val();if(ordercount>0){icd10container.text(defaulticd10texts);icd10field.val(defaulticd10s);}
else if(selectedicd10id!=''){var defaultdisplay='';CreateSNOMEDICD10Picker({JQPICKERCONTAINER:icd10container,SNOMEDCODE:snomedcode,ICD10CODEALLID:selectedicd10id,INITIALDISPLAY:defaultdisplay,ONSELECT:UpdateDocumentDiagnosisICD10,DONOTDEFAULTICD10:donotdefaulticd10});ICD10PickerFetchSNOMEDData(snomedcode,null,null,function(snomedicd10data){ICD10PickerSetModel(icd10container,snomedicd10data);var model=icd10container.data();if(!model.SNOMEDICD10||!model.SNOMEDICD10.ICD10.length){icd10container.text(noneselectedtext);icd10field.val('');}
else{icd10field.val(model.ICDCODEALLID);}});}}
function UpdateDocumentDiagnosisICD10Options(snomedcode){var jqdiv=jQuery('#documentdiagnosiscodeicd10view');var icd10field=jQuery("#DOCUMENTDIAGNOSISCODEICD10");icd10field.val(-1);if(jqdiv.size()>0&&snomedcode){InitDocumentICD10Picker();var needsverification=jQuery("#SNOMEDDIAGNOSISNEEDSVERIFICATION");needsverification.val(0);}
else if(!snomedcode){jqdiv.html('');icd10field.val('');}}
function UpdateDocumentDiagnosisICD10(icd10data){var selectedval=icd10data.ICDCODEALLID;var icd10field=jQuery("#DOCUMENTDIAGNOSISCODEICD10");var previousval=icd10field.val();if(previousval!=selectedval){icd10field.val(selectedval);}}
function HCCRAFEnabled(){var fieldvalue=jQuery('#USEHCCRAFENHANCEMENTS').val();return(fieldvalue&&Number(fieldvalue)!==0);}
(function(window){window.IsICD10=function(){return jQuery("#icd10enabledflag").length;};}(window));function ICD10DeletePicker(dxordering){var icd10deletebutton=jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering+'_ICD10ROWCONTENT .deleteicd10picker');if(icd10deletebutton.length){var icd10displayinbar=jQuery(icd10deletebutton[0].previousSibling).parents('.diagnosisheading')
.children('.diagnosisbanner').find('.diagnosisicd10labelcontent');var icdcodeallid=jQuery(icd10deletebutton[0].previousSibling).data().ICDCODEALLID;_RemoveICD10Code(icdcodeallid,dxordering);_RemoveICD10Description(icdcodeallid,dxordering);jQuery(icd10deletebutton).closest('.diagnosisheading').children('.diagnosisbanner').find('span.diagnosisicd10descriptionatend').html('');jQuery(icd10deletebutton[0].previousSibling).remove();jQuery(icd10deletebutton[0].parentNode).removeClass('displayinlineblock');icd10deletebutton.closest('.icd10rowcontent').find('.icd10dxrafspan').remove();icd10deletebutton.remove();}}
function ICD10MakeDeleteButton(dxordering){return jQuery('<a class="deleteicd10picker" title="Delete ICD-10" style="cursor: pointer; position: absolute; right: -20px; top: 6px"></a>')
.click(function(){ICD10DeletePicker(dxordering);})
.append('<span class="sprite-del-16x16"></span>');}
var editspecificityfield="&nbsp;<span class='jslink' onclick='var block = jQuery(this).closest(\".diagnosisblock\"); block.data(\"focusicd10picker\", true)' data-openicd10picker='1'>Edit specificity</span>";function buildeditspecificityhtmlonpick(pickermodel){var icd10count=pickermodel.SNOMEDICD10.ICD10.length;var icd10prt0=jQuery.grep(pickermodel.SNOMEDICD10.ICD10,function(icd10){return icd10.PRIORITY==0;});if(icd10count>1&&icd10prt0.length===1){if(icd10prt0[0].ID==pickermodel.ICDCODEALLID){return editspecificityfield;}else{return'';}}
return undefined;}
function ICD10BuildBlock(snomedcode,snomeddescription,icdcodeallid,initialdisplay,dxordering){var newprimarypicker=jQuery('<div></div>')
.appendTo('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering+'_ICD10ROWCONTENT div.icd10dx')
.after(ICD10MakeDeleteButton(dxordering));var icd10displayinbar=newprimarypicker.parents('.diagnosisheading').children('.diagnosisbanner').find('.diagnosisicd10labelcontent');var icd10codeboldpretext=icd10displayinbar.prev();var jqinput=jQuery('[name="ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{'+dxordering+'}{ICD10DATAMODEL}"]');var i10model={AJAXFIRED:true,GLOBALPICKERPICKED:[]};jqinput.data(i10model);if(icdcodeallid&&initialdisplay!==''){_AddOrChangePickerDiagnosis(icdcodeallid,initialdisplay,dxordering);icd10codeboldpretext.show();}else{var needtopick="<span class='jslink'";needtopick+=(icdcodeallid!==1)?" onclick='var block = jQuery(this).closest(\".diagnosisblock\"); block.data(\"focusicd10picker\", true)' data-openicd10picker='1'":"";needtopick+=">Select ICD-10 code (required)</span>";icd10displayinbar.html(needtopick);icd10codeboldpretext.hide();icdcodeallid=-1;jqinput.val(icdcodeallid);}
if(initialdisplay===''){initialdisplay='No default ICD-10 mapping available';}
CreateSNOMEDICD10Picker({JQPICKERCONTAINER:newprimarypicker,SNOMEDCODE:snomedcode,ICD10CODEALLID:icdcodeallid,INITIALDISPLAY:initialdisplay,ONSELECT:function(pickermodel){_AddOrChangePickerDiagnosis(pickermodel.ICDCODEALLID,pickermodel.DISPLAY,dxordering,buildeditspecificityhtmlonpick(pickermodel),pickermodel);UpdateDxMissingICD(jQuery(document.getElementsByName("ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS_NEEDSICD9CODE")));},PREPICKCHECKCALLBACK:function(icdcodeallid){return jqinput.val().indexOf(icdcodeallid)===-1;}});var linkcontainer=jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering+'_ICD10ROWCONTENT div.icd10dxaddlink');linkcontainer.addClass('display-none');ICD10PickerFetchSNOMEDData(snomedcode,null,null,function(snomedicd10data){ICD10PickerSetModel(newprimarypicker,snomedicd10data);var updatedmodel=newprimarypicker.data();if(typeof updatedmodel.SNOMEDICD10==='object'){if(updatedmodel.ICDCODEALLID!='-1'){var enddesc=buildeditspecificityhtmlonpick(updatedmodel);_AddOrChangePickerDiagnosis(updatedmodel.ICDCODEALLID,updatedmodel.DISPLAY,dxordering,enddesc,updatedmodel);}
else{if(!updatedmodel.SNOMEDICD10.ICD10||updatedmodel.SNOMEDICD10.ICD10.length==0){ICD10DeletePicker(dxordering);}}}
linkcontainer.removeClass('display-none');linkcontainer.slideDown(300,function(){linkcontainer.css('overflow','visible');});linkcontainer.children('span').click(function(){if(this.nextSibling&&this.nextSibling.className==='icd10globalpickercontainer'){jQuery(this.nextSibling).remove();return;}
var ctnr=jQuery(this).parent();snomedicd10data.SNOMEDDESC=snomeddescription;CreateICD10GlobalPicker(ctnr,snomedicd10data,function(icdcodeallid,code,desc,jqselected){_AddICD10Row(icdcodeallid,code+": "+desc,jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering+'_ICD10DXADDITIONAL'),null,null,jqselected.data('raf'),false);});});UpdateDxMissingICD(jQuery(document.getElementsByName("ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS_NEEDSICD9CODE")));});}
function ICD10LoadSNOMED(jqicd10rowcontent){var jqpickercontainer=jqicd10rowcontent.children('.icd10dx').children('.icd10snomedpickercontainer');var jqinput=jqicd10rowcontent.children('input.icd10datamodel');var dxordering=jqinput.parents(".diagnosisblock").attr("diagnosisordering");var i10model=jqinput.data();var SNOMEDpickermodel=jqpickercontainer.data();if(jqpickercontainer.length>1){return;}
var linkcontainer=jqicd10rowcontent.children('.icd10dxaddlink');linkcontainer.addClass('display-none');if(jqicd10rowcontent.length>0&&!i10model.AJAXFIRED){i10model.AJAXFIRED=true;var snomedcode=SNOMEDpickermodel?SNOMEDpickermodel.SNOMEDCODE:jqicd10rowcontent.closest('.diagnosisblock').attr('diagnosiscode');ICD10PickerFetchSNOMEDData(snomedcode,null,null,function(snomedicd10data){if(jqpickercontainer.length>0){ICD10PickerSetModel(jqpickercontainer,snomedicd10data);var updatedmodel=jqpickercontainer.data();if(updatedmodel.ICDCODEALLID!='-1'){var enddesc=buildeditspecificityhtmlonpick(updatedmodel);_AddOrChangePickerDiagnosis(updatedmodel.ICDCODEALLID,updatedmodel.DISPLAY,dxordering,enddesc,updatedmodel);}}
linkcontainer.removeClass('display-none');linkcontainer.children('span').click(function(){if(this.nextSibling&&this.nextSibling.className==='icd10globalpickercontainer'){jQuery(this.nextSibling).remove();return;}
var linkctnr=jQuery(this).parent();snomedicd10data.SNOMEDDESC=jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering+' .diagnosisheading table td.diagnosisbannertitle .diagnosisdescription .diagnosisdescriptionlabel').html();CreateICD10GlobalPicker(linkctnr,snomedicd10data,function(icdcodeallid,code,desc,jqselected){_AddICD10Row(icdcodeallid,code+": "+desc,jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering+'_ICD10DXADDITIONAL'),null,null,jqselected.data('raf'),false);});});});}}
function ICD10Restore(jqinput,isstatic){if(!jqinput.length)return;var edxenabled=OnOrderSetAdminPage()&&OrderSetEnhancedDiagnosesEnabled();var parsed=jqinput.val()?JSON.parse(jqinput.val()):[];var dxblock=jqinput.closest('.diagnosisblock');var dxordering=dxblock.attr('diagnosisordering');if(!edxenabled&&!isstatic&&parsed.length>=1){var newprimarypicker=jQuery('<div></div>')
.appendTo(jqinput.siblings(".icd10dx"))
.after(ICD10MakeDeleteButton(dxordering));var icdcodeallid=parsed[0].ICDCODEALLID;var initialdisplay=parsed[0].DESCRIPTION;var icd10displayinbar=jqinput.closest('.diagnosisheading').children('.diagnosisbanner').find('.diagnosisicd10labelcontent');var icd10codeboldpretext=icd10displayinbar.prev();var raf;if(HCCRAFEnabled()&&isDefined(parsed[0].RAF)){raf=parsed[0].RAF;}
jqinput=jQuery(document.getElementsByName("ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{"+dxordering+"}{ICD10DATAMODEL}"));jqinput.data({AJAXFIRED:false,GLOBALPICKERPICKED:[]});if(icdcodeallid==-1){jqinput.val(icdcodeallid);var icd10codeanddescription="<span class='jslink'>Select ICD-10 code (required)</span>";icd10displayinbar.html(icd10codeanddescription);icd10codeboldpretext.addClass('display-none');initialdisplay="No default ICD-10 mapping available";}else{icd10displayinbar.html("");jqinput.val("");if(!isDefined(raf)){_AddOrChangePickerDiagnosis(icdcodeallid,initialdisplay,dxordering);}
else{_AddOrChangePickerDiagnosis(icdcodeallid,initialdisplay,dxordering,undefined,{SELECTEDDATA:{raf:raf}});}
icd10codeboldpretext.removeClass('display-none');}
CreateSNOMEDICD10Picker({JQPICKERCONTAINER:newprimarypicker,SNOMEDCODE:dxblock.attr('diagnosiscode'),ICD10CODEALLID:icdcodeallid,INITIALDISPLAY:initialdisplay,ONSELECT:function(pickermodel){_AddOrChangePickerDiagnosis(pickermodel.ICDCODEALLID,pickermodel.DISPLAY,dxordering,buildeditspecificityhtmlonpick(pickermodel),pickermodel);UpdateDxMissingICD(jQuery(document.getElementsByName("ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS_NEEDSICD9CODE")));},PREPICKCHECKCALLBACK:function(icdcodeallid){return jqinput.val().indexOf(icdcodeallid)===-1;}});var linkcontainer=jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering+'_ICD10ROWCONTENT').find('div.icd10dxaddlink');linkcontainer.addClass('display-none');UpdateDxMissingICD(jQuery(document.getElementsByName('ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS_NEEDSICD9CODE')));}
var startingindex;if(isstatic){startingindex=0;jqinput.val("");}
else if(edxenabled){startingindex=0;jqinput.val("");}
else{startingindex=1;}
for(var i=startingindex;i<parsed.length;i++){_AddICD10Row(parsed[i].ICDCODEALLID,parsed[i].DESCRIPTION,jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering+'_ICD10DXADDITIONAL'),null,isstatic,parsed[i].RAF,parsed[i].SUPPLEMENTALYN==='Y');}
if(!edxenabled){setTimeout(function(){ICD10LoadSNOMED(jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+dxordering).find('.icd10rowcontent'));},500+dxordering*300);}}
function GetICD10CodeList(snomedordering){var icd10codeids={};if(OrderSetEnhancedDiagnosesEnabled()){var icd10datamodel=document.getElementsByName('ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{'+snomedordering+'}{ICD10DATAMODEL}')[0];var supplementalicd10datamodel=document.getElementsByName('ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{'+snomedordering+'}{SUPPLEMENTALICD10}')[0];icd10codeids['primary']=icd10datamodel.value?icd10datamodel.value.split("\t"):[];icd10codeids['supplemental']=supplementalicd10datamodel.value?supplementalicd10datamodel.value.split("\t"):[];return icd10codeids;}
else{var datamodel=document.getElementsByName('ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{'+snomedordering+'}{ICD10DATAMODEL}')[0];icd10codeids['primary']=datamodel.value?datamodel.value.split("\t"):[];return icd10codeids;}}
function RemoveICD10Row(icd10,icdcodeallid,snomedordering,jqblock,icd10codestring){_RemoveICD10Code(icdcodeallid,snomedordering);_RemoveICD10Description(icdcodeallid,snomedordering,jqblock,icd10codestring);jQuery(icd10).find('.icd10rafspan').remove();jQuery(icd10).closest('.diagnosisicd10row').remove();}
function _RemoveICD10Code(icdcodeallid,snomedordering){var datamodel=jQuery(EscapeJQuerySelector("[name='ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{"+snomedordering+"}{ICD10DATAMODEL}']"));var icd10codeids=datamodel.val().split("\t");var remainingicd10codeids=[];for(var i=0;i<icd10codeids.length;i++){if(!(icd10codeids[i]==icdcodeallid)){remainingicd10codeids.push(icd10codeids[i]);}}
datamodel.val(remainingicd10codeids.join("\t"));if(OrderSetEnhancedDiagnosesEnabled()){var supplementaldatamodel=jQuery(EscapeJQuerySelector("[name='ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{"+snomedordering+"}{SUPPLEMENTALICD10}']"));var supplementalicd10codeids=supplementaldatamodel.val().split("\t");var supplementalremainingicd10codeids=[];for(var j=0;j<supplementalicd10codeids.length;j++){if(!(supplementalicd10codeids[j]==icdcodeallid)){supplementalremainingicd10codeids.push(supplementalicd10codeids[j]);}}
supplementaldatamodel.val(supplementalremainingicd10codeids.join("\t"));}
UpdateDxMissingICD(jQuery(document.getElementsByName("ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS_NEEDSICD9CODE")));if(!remainingicd10codeids.length&&HCCRAFEnabled()){jQuery("#DIAGNOSIS_"+snomedordering).addClass('needsicd');}
require(['shared:/scripts/athena/utils/cross_frame_events'],function(CrossFrameEvents){CrossFrameEvents.trigger('ICD10DataModelChangedEvent',snomedordering);});}
function _RemoveICD10Description(icdcodeallid,snomedordering,jqblock,icd10codestring){var icd10description=jQuery("#DIAGNOSIS_ICD10_DESCRIPTION_"+snomedordering);var icd10label=icd10description.find(".diagnosisicd10labelcontent");icd10label.find("span[icdcodeallid='"+icdcodeallid+"']").remove();if(jqblock&&OrderSetEnhancedDiagnosesEnabled()){for(var i=0;i<jqblock.children().length;i++){var icd10additionalforindex=jQuery("#DIAGNOSIS_"+snomedordering+"_ICD10DXADDITIONAL_"+i);if(icd10additionalforindex&&icd10additionalforindex.length){var icd10rowhtml=icd10additionalforindex.html();var icd10rowhtmlstripped=icd10rowhtml&&icd10rowhtml.split('.').join("");if(icd10rowhtmlstripped.indexOf(icd10codestring)!==-1||icd10rowhtml.indexOf(icd10codestring)!==-1){jQuery("#DIAGNOSIS_"+snomedordering+"_ICD10DXADDITIONAL_"+i).get(0).remove();}}}}
var remainingicd10descs=[]
icd10label.find("span[icdcodeallid]").each(function(){remainingicd10descs.push(this.outerHTML);});if(remainingicd10descs.length){icd10label.html(remainingicd10descs.join("; "));}
else{icd10label.html("<span class='jslink'>Select ICD-10 code (required)</span>");rowlabel=icd10description.find(".diagnosisicd10rowlabel").addClass('display-none');}}
function GetICD10DeleteLink(icdcodeallid,snomedordering){return"<a title='Delete ICD-10' style='position:absolute; top:0px; right: -22px;' onclick='RemoveICD10Row(this,"+icdcodeallid+","+snomedordering+");'><span class='sprite-del-16x16 sprite-link'></span></a>";}
function _AddICD10Code(newicd10code,snomedordering,issupplemental){var datamodel;if(issupplemental){datamodel=document.getElementsByName('ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{'+snomedordering+'}{SUPPLEMENTALICD10}')[0];}
else{datamodel=document.getElementsByName('ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{'+snomedordering+'}{ICD10DATAMODEL}')[0];}
var prefix='';if(datamodel.value.length){prefix=datamodel.value+"\t";}
datamodel.value=prefix+newicd10code;UpdateDxMissingICD(jQuery(document.getElementsByName("ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS_NEEDSICD9CODE")));if(HCCRAFEnabled()){jQuery("#DIAGNOSIS_"+snomedordering).removeClass('needsicd');}
require(['shared:/scripts/athena/utils/cross_frame_events'],function(CrossFrameEvents){CrossFrameEvents.trigger('ICD10DataModelChangedEvent',snomedordering);});}
function _AddOrChangePickerDiagnosis(icdcodeallid,desc,snomedordering,descriptionatend,pickermodel){var icd10description=jQuery("#DIAGNOSIS_ICD10_DESCRIPTION_"+snomedordering);var icd10label=icd10description.find(".diagnosisicd10labelcontent");var pickerdescription=icd10label.find("[frompicker=true]");var datamodel=jQuery(document.getElementsByName('ENCOUNTERDIAGNOSIS{'+snomedordering+'}{ICD10DATAMODEL}'));var diagnosesICDs=GetICD10CodeList(snomedordering);var diagnoses=diagnosesICDs?diagnosesICDs['primary'].concat(diagnosesICDs['supplemental']?diagnosesICDs['supplemental']:[]):[];if(pickerdescription.length>0){pickerdescription.attr("icdcodeallid",icdcodeallid);pickerdescription.html(desc);diagnoses[0]=icdcodeallid;datamodel.val(diagnoses.join("\t"));}
else{suffixes=['',''];if(icd10label.find("span[icdcodeallid]").length>0){suffixes=["; ","\t"];}
else{icd10description.find(".diagnosisicd10rowlabel").removeClass('display-none');icd10label.html("");}
icd10label.prepend("<span icdcodeallid='"+icdcodeallid+"' frompicker=true>"+desc+"</span>"+suffixes[0]);if(diagnoses.length>0&&diagnoses[0]=='-1'){diagnoses[0]=icdcodeallid;datamodel.val(diagnoses.join("\t"));}
else{datamodel.val(icdcodeallid+suffixes[1]+datamodel.val());}}
if(typeof descriptionatend!=='undefined'){icd10description.find('.diagnosisicd10descriptionatend').html(descriptionatend);}
if(HCCRAFEnabled()){var raf=null;if(pickermodel){if(pickermodel.SELECTEDDATA){raf=pickermodel.SELECTEDDATA.raf||'0';}
else if(pickermodel.SNOMEDICD10&&pickermodel.SNOMEDICD10.IDTOI10&&pickermodel.SNOMEDICD10.IDTOI10[icdcodeallid]&&isDefined(pickermodel.SNOMEDICD10.IDTOI10[icdcodeallid].RAF)){raf=pickermodel.SNOMEDICD10.IDTOI10[icdcodeallid].RAF;}}
AddOrChangeICD10PickerRAF(snomedordering,icdcodeallid,raf);}
jQuery("#DIAGNOSIS_"+snomedordering).removeClass('needsicd');require(['shared:/scripts/athena/utils/cross_frame_events'],function(CrossFrameEvents){CrossFrameEvents.trigger('ICD10DataModelChangedEvent',snomedordering);});}
function _AddToICD10HeaderText(icdcodeallid,desc,snomedordering){var icd10description=jQuery("#DIAGNOSIS_ICD10_DESCRIPTION_"+snomedordering);var icd10label=icd10description.find(".diagnosisicd10labelcontent");var rowlabel=icd10description.find(".diagnosisicd10rowlabel");var prefix='';if(icd10label.find("span[icdcodeallid]").length>0){prefix="; ";}
else{rowlabel.show();icd10label.html('');}
icd10label.append(prefix+"<span icdcodeallid='"+icdcodeallid+"' frompicker = false >"+desc+"</span>");}
function _AddICD10Row(newicd10code,desc,jqblock,supressalerts,isstatic,raf,issupplemental){var icd10count=jqblock.children('div').length;var snomeddxid=jqblock.selector;var reg=/DIAGNOSIS_(.*)_ICD10DXADDITIONAL/;var snomedordering=reg.exec(snomeddxid)[1];var icd10codes={};icd10codes=GetICD10CodeList(snomedordering);icd10codes=icd10codes?icd10codes['primary'].concat(icd10codes['supplemental']?icd10codes['supplemental']:[]):[];if(icd10codes){for(var i=0;i<icd10codes.length;i++){if(newicd10code==icd10codes[i]){if(!supressalerts){alert("The selected ICD-10 code has already been added:\n"+desc);}
return;}}}
_AddICD10Code(newicd10code,snomedordering,issupplemental);_AddToICD10HeaderText(newicd10code,desc,snomedordering);var hidedeletelink=isstatic||(OrderSetEnhancedDiagnosesEnabled()&&!issupplemental);var deletelink=hidedeletelink?'':GetICD10DeleteLink(newicd10code,snomedordering);var newrow=jQuery('<div/>',{id:"DIAGNOSIS_"+snomedordering+"_ICD10DXADDITIONAL_"+icd10count,html:"<span class='displayinlineblock' style='position: relative'>"+desc+deletelink+"</span>"}).addClass("diagnosisicd10row").appendTo(jqblock);if(HCCRAFEnabled()){AddICD10RafSpan(newrow,newicd10code,raf);}}
function AddICD10RafSpan(jqrow,icd10code,raf){if(raf||''+raf=='0'){_AddICD10RAFSpan(jqrow,raf);}
else{if(icd10code){var spinner=new BusyIndicator();var busydiv=jQuery('<span>').addClass(".rafspan").appendTo(jqrow);if(busydiv){spinner.Start(busydiv,{size:jQuery(busydiv).height(),ticks:8,tickradius:8,tickwidth:8});}
CallRemote({SUBSYSTEM:'P4P',SUB:'GetICDCodeAllHCCDetails',ARGS:{ICDCODEALLIDS:[icd10code]},ONFINISH:function(rafs){busydiv.remove();if(icd10code&&rafs[icd10code]&&rafs[icd10code][0]){var raf=PrependZeroIfDecimalNumber(rafs[icd10code][0]['RAF']);_AddICD10RAFSpan(jqrow,raf);}}});}}}
function _AddICD10RAFSpan(jqrow,raf){if(raf){jqrow.append(jQuery("<span class='icd10rafspan'></span>").text(raf));}}
function AddOrChangeICD10PickerRAF(snomedordering,icdcodeallid,raf){if(raf||''+raf=='0'){_AddOrChangeICD10PickerRAF(snomedordering,raf);}
else{if(icdcodeallid){var spinner=new BusyIndicator();var busydiv=jQuery('<span>').addClass(".rafspan").prependTo(jQuery('#DIAGNOSIS_'+snomedordering+'_ICD10ROWCONTENT'));if(busydiv){spinner.Start(busydiv,{size:jQuery(busydiv).height(),ticks:8,tickradius:8,tickwidth:8});}
